\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0 Seeing I am Jesus' lamb,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 Always glad at heart I am
\par O'er my shepherd good and loving
\par Who's for all my needs providing
\par He, His lamb by name doth call
\par For He knows and loves us all.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  By His gentle staff I'm led,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0  On green pastures I am fed;
\par  Bounteous grace on me bestowing,
\par  On the best of meadows going,
\par  When I thirst, His lamb He brings
\par  To the cool, refreshing springs.
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  Should I not rejoice in this?
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0\qj As a grateful lamb, I'm His.
\par For when these great days have ended,
\par Safely by His arms defended,
\par To my home He'll carry me,
\par \pard      Great my happiness will be. \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

